ny, are placed at the *bottom* of the matrix.\n- Each leading entry of a row is in a column *to the right* of the leading entry of the row above it.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each matrix in turn.\n\n- The matrix $A$ is not in row echelon form since the first row contains only zeros and it is not at the bottom of the matrix (condition I is violated).\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $A$ is **not** in row echelon form."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262993 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e30324bc-6900-5254-92e9-cf2aca39bde3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463736} {:answer/id #uuid "06d26bf2-c836-5a8b-a49b-0b24d4662c95" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463737}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463737} :answer-field/id #uuid "b2dbf0bc-3740-5108-a59e-4bc3cdd55cb6" :answer-field/key "A" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464802} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "258097c5-0612-5d04-9080-26317759ad82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463738} {:answer/id #uuid "194ae8ca-0509-5578-8e55-4c57a8b6f54f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463739}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463739} :an