ix $A$ is not in row echelon form since the leading entry ${a}_{45}\\ne 0$ (condition II is violated). \n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $B$ and $C$ are in row echelon form."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400422 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a6a10c6a-c273-5b60-aa1d-e7a83843eb27" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472598} {:answer/id #uuid "f0d03d0c-023e-5dfc-96d5-00773119971d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472599}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472599} :answer-field/id #uuid "cbd4469b-951d-544d-97f3-8ed77d2160e8" :answer-field/key "A" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473694} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e0548548-12e3-5f3a-9a0d-c7bb8784abca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472600} {:answer/id #uuid "0dba5fad-44f1-5962-b40c-1a4bf7ea4791" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472601}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472601} :answer-field/id #uuid "5131e743-cc81-5654-9cd6-1dd3499199fc" :answer-field/key "B" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473695} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3