bmatrix}3 & 2 & 5 & -9 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 7 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The first non-zero entry of each row (from left to right) is the leading entry. \n\nTherefore, the leading entries of the $2$nd and $4$th rows of  $A$ are $-4$ and $7$, respectively.\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & 5 & -9 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 7 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nSo, the answer is $-4+7=3.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186341839 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a4fe252b-4d8e-5f30-afa5-98fdf6e7ca59" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340627} {:answer/id #uuid "adc15588-38a9-5dc0-aac1-11ebfe9ea1b3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340711} {:answer/id #uuid "d40c8607-a31a-5c01-90a1-c4575f4c1078" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341004} {:answer/id #uuid "e38be46b-9c6c-5660-a0cd-50f9e146e7b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341143} {:answer/id #uuid "fd06971b-d2b2-5b03-a852-82f1f981d3ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341364}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340711} :answer-field/id #uuid "c50653fc-741b-5723-b1e5-d9a62812fc8d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341724}] :question/id #uuid "6e33d1be-d21f-5496-9987-25f3728e4904" :question/math-academy-id "q-72577" :question/problem "What is the sum of the leading entries of the $1$st, $2$nd, and $4$th rows in the matrix $A,$ given below?\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 5 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The first non-zero entry of each row (from